flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[User Login]
    B --> C[Authentication & JWT Validation]
    C --> D[Open Dashboard]
    D --> E[Configure SLA Rules / Thresholds]
    E --> F[Start Monitoring Cycle]
    F --> G[Collect Metrics from Services]
    G --> H[Resource Monitoring Agent]
    H --> I[Response Time Agent]
    I --> J[SLA Verification Agent]
    J --> K{Is SLA Violated?}

    K -- Yes --> L[Alert Agent]
    L --> M[Recommendation Agent]
    M --> N[Generate Report]
    N --> O[Store Results in SQLite]
    O --> P[Dashboard Update]
    P --> Q[Continue Monitoring]
    Q --> F

    K -- No --> Q

    Q --> R([End])
